        "x1": 515.9,
        "tag": "dict",
        "entryNumber": 7,
        "text": "7 /ˌhaɪəˈrɑːkɪkəl/ has a structure with important"
      },
      {
        "y": 165.4,
        "x0": 107.1,
        "x1": 304.9,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "support. Last month we got a new boss, who quickly"
      },
      {
        "y": 173.5,
        "x0": 340.4,
        "x1": 439.4,
        "tag": "dict",
        "text": "and less important people"
      },
      {
        "y": 176.4,
        "x0": 107.1,
        "x1": 287.7,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "established a good rapport5 with everyone. She"
      },
      {
        "y": 184.5,
        "x0": 335.3,
        "x1": 527.1,
        "tag": "dict",
        "entryNumber": 8,
        "text": "8 a system where some people have the right to get"
      },
      {
        "y": 188.4,
        "x0": 107.1,
        "x1": 302.1,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "likes us to take the initiative6. The company is very"
      },
      {
        "y": 196.5,
        "x0": 340.4,
        "x1": 470.5,
        "tag": "dict",
        "text": "benefits/promotions before others"
      },
      {
        "y": 200.4,
        "x0": 107.1,
        "x1": 311.2,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "hierarchical7; there’s a pecking order8 for everything."
      },
      {
        "y": 207.5,
        "x0": 335.3,
        "x1": 519.8,
        "tag": "dict",
        "entryNumber": 9,
        "text": "9 an agreement where two people each share the"
      },
      {
        "y": 212.4,
        "x0": 107.1,
        "x1": 317.7,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "I do a job-share9 with a woman called Rose, which suits"
      },
      {
        "y": 219.5,
        "x0": 340.4,
        "x1": 374.8,
        "tag": "dict",
        "text": "same job"
      },
      {
        "y": 225.4,
        "x0": 107.1,
        "x1": 312.6,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "us as we each have childcare responsibilities. My office"
      },
      {
        "y": 230.5,
        "x0": 333.1,
        "x1": 518,
        "tag": "dict",
        "entryNumber": 10,
        "text": "10 a policy of sharing desks in an office, so people"
      },
      {
        "y": 236.4,
        "x0": 107.1,
        "x1": 315.4,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "uses a hot-desking10 system, so I sit in a different place"
      },
      {
        "y": 242.5,
        "x0": 341.4,
        "x1": 518.2,
        "tag": "dict",
        "text": "sit at whichever desk is free on a particular day"
      },
      {
        "y": 248.4,
        "x0": 107.1,
        "x1": 309.4,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "every day. I socialise with my workmates11 outside of"
      },
      {
        "y": 253.5,
        "x0": 333.1,
        "x1": 512.1,
        "tag": "dict",
        "entryNumber": 11,
        "text": "11 colleagues you are friendly with (especially in"
      },
      {
        "y": 260.4,
        "x0": 107.1,
        "x1": 314.7,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "work, but we try not to talk shop12 on those occasions."
      },
      {
        "y": 265.5,
        "x0": 341.4,
        "x1": 491.6,
        "tag": "dict",
        "text": "non-professional occupations); informal"
      },
      {
        "y": 276.5,
        "x0": 333.1,
        "x1": 436.4,
        "tag": "dict",
        "entryNumber": 12,
        "text": "12 talk about work; informal"
      },
      {
        "y": 283.3,
        "x0": 74.7,
        "x1": 322.6,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "B During the day (different work patterns)"
      },
      {
        "y": 306.5,
        "x0": 171.8,
        "x1": 475.9,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "I do fairly mundane1 tasks. Occasionally I have to meet a deadline2 or they need"
      },
      {
        "y": 318.5,
        "x0": 177.8,
        "x1": 465.1,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "someone to volunteer3 for something. Then the job is more rewarding4 and"
      },
      {
        "y": 330.5,
        "x0": 183.8,
        "x1": 482.1,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "stimulating5. Sometimes I have a heavy workload6 but at other times it can be"
      },
      {
        "y": 343.5,
        "x0": 189.8,
        "x1": 230.7,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "quite light."
      },
      {
        "y": 360.2,
        "x0": 99.7,
        "x1": 521.5,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "1 ordinary, not interesting 2 have something finished by a fixed day or time 3 offer to do something without"
      },
      {
        "y": 371.2,
        "x0": 99.7,
        "x1": 517.4,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "being asked or told to do it 4 making you feel satisfied that you have done something important or useful, or"
      },
      {
        "y": 382.2,
        "x0": 99.7,
        "x1": 469.8,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "done something well 5 encouraging new ideas or new thinking 6 amount of work I have to do"
      },
      {
        "y": 404.4,
        "x0": 172.3,
        "x1": 469.2,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "I start work at my machine at seven o’clock when I’m on the day shift. The job’s"
      },
      {
        "y": 415.6,
        "x0": 176.3,
        "x1": 490.5,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "mechanical1 and repetitive2. All I ever think about is knocking off3 at three o’clock."
      },
      {
        "y": 428.4,
        "x0": 181.3,
        "x1": 490.9,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "The shift I hate most is the night shift. I start at ten and work till six in the morning."
      },
      {
        "y": 439.6,
        "x0": 185.3,
        "x1": 496.6,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "It’s a bit monotonous4. It’s not a satisfying5 job – I feel I need something a bit more"
      },
      {
        "y": 451.6,
        "x0": 190.3,
        "x1": 242,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "challenging6."
      },
      {
        "y": 470.8,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 448.1,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "1 you don’t have to think about what you are doing 2 the same thing is repeated every day"
      },
      {
        "y": 481.8,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 474.2,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "3 finishing work; informal 4 boring because it never changes 5 (does not) make me feel pleased"
      },
      {
        "y": 492.8,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 383,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "by providing what I need or want 6 that tests my ability or determination"
      },
      {
        "y": 515.5,
        "x0": 172.8,
        "x1": 500.2,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "I have a pretty glamorous1 job. I’m a pilot. But the hours are irregular and anti-social2."
      },
      {
        "y": 527.5,
        "x0": 177.8,
        "x1": 500.5,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "I’m not stuck behind a desk3, but long-haul flights can be a bit mind-numbing4; most"
      },
      {
        "y": 539.5,
        "x0": 181.8,
        "x1": 501.2,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "of the time the plane just flies itself. We work to very tight schedules5. But I shouldn’t"
      },
      {
        "y": 551.5,
        "x0": 186.8,
        "x1": 507.5,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "complain. I feel sorry for people who are stuck in a rut6 or who are in dead-end7 jobs."
      },
      {
        "y": 574,
        "x0": 99.7,
        "x1": 497.7,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "1 very exciting, which everyone admires 2 do not enable one to have a normal social life 3 sitting at a"
      },
      {
        "y": 585,
        "x0": 99.7,
        "x1": 432.2,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "desk all day; informal 4 extremely boring 5 very strict or severely limited timetables"
      },
      {
        "y": 596,
        "x0": 99.7,
        "x1": 413.8,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "6 stuck/trapped in a job they can’t escape from 7 with no prospects of promotion"
      },
      {
        "y": 616.6,
        "x0": 172.8,
        "x1": 506.8,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "I started off as a technician1. After retraining, I worked for a software company, and later I"
      },
      {
        "y": 628.6,
        "x0": 176.8,
        "x1": 506.8,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "went in with2 a friend and we formed our own software company as a start-up3 in 2009,"
      },
      {
        "y": 640.6,
        "x0": 180.8,
        "x1": 491,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "so now I’m self-employed. My husband is freelance4: he works for several different"
      },
      {
        "y": 652.6,
        "x0": 184.8,
        "x1": 479.4,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "companies as and when they need work done – he’s a computer programmer5."
      },
      {
        "y": 674.2,
        "x0": 99.6,
        "x1": 491.7,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "1 person whose job involves practical work with scientific or electrical equipment 2 formed a business"
      },
      {
        "y": 685.2,
        "x0": 99.6,
        "x1": 505,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "partnership with 3 a small business that has just started 4 or works freelance 5 someone who writes"
      },
      {
